keywords:
  - ternary phase diagram
  - Flory-Huggins
  - binodal
  - spinodal
  - membrane
  - phase inversion
  - cloud point
abstract: >-
  A browser program for Flory-Huggins phase diagrams of polymer, solvent and non-solvent systems, as used to plan membrane casting by phase inversion: binodal, spinodal, tie-lines, critical point, cloud points of a casting dope, and downloads of every curve. The only measured data are nine published cloud points (Ishaque 2020), cited in the program.
